{"id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-s-m-n-theorem.md","title":"S-m-n Theorem","display":"thm-s-m-n-theorem — S-m-n Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-s-m-n-theorem"],"display":"thm-s-m-n-theorem — S-m-n Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]","[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§8.6 pp.24-25 / PDF 33-34","verification_status":"source-adapted-and-derived","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-s-m-n-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-s-m-n-theorem — S-m-n Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e745949a6ee96af\" href=\"?note=9e745949a6ee96af\" title=\"68-thm-universal-function-theorem\">68-thm-universal-function-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.6 pp.24-25 / PDF 33-34"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-and-derived"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 包括零元情形，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>；有限序列连接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\,^{\\frown}\">\\(\\,^{\\frown}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle e\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{m+1}\">\\(\\langle e\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{m+n}\">\\(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^{m+n}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{m+1}}\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\\varphi_{s(\\langle e\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\vec y)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{m+1}}\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\\left(\\varphi_{s(\\langle e\\rangle\\,^{\\frown}\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\vec y)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>8.6 Parameter Theorem，印刷 pp.24–25 / PDF pp.33–34。原书先给定一个 (k+m) 元递归函数，再生成固定 m 个参数的程序索引；对 8.2 的通用求值函数应用它，即得到此处统一包含索引 e 的 s-m-n 版本。参数序列重新排列可由投影复合实现；零元情形没有省略。原有多元 φ 只以中文命名且没有来源，现在已有实际多元定义。已读并复核原书移位程序构造证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-universal-function-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"9e745949a6ee96af","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 